{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.muddypawsrescue.org/adopt","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Unknown","breed_primary":"Unknown","description_text":"Hi, I’m Balto a very sweet and friendly boy! I am also very clever and a little bit mischievous. I love long walks and belly rubs. My favorite is for us to hang out together even if I’m just snoozing while you’re working. I am a great eater and will often ask to see what you’re munching too. I also walk very well on my leash, but I am also eager to say hello and make new friends. I love chasing rats and mice and squirrels.\n\n﻿Balto is approximately 6y 0m 24d old and is fully grown at 38 pounds. They are microchipped and up to date on all age-appropriate medical care. Their breed is unknown as we have not had a DNA test done.\n\nAlthough our dogs are listed as unknown breed, buildings with specific dog restrictions typically enforce their rules based on what breeds a dog appears to resemble. It's always important to keep that in mind and know your building's policies before adopting a dog.\n\nThis dog is available for adoption through Muddy Paws Rescue. If you're interested in adopting, the first thing you should do is begin the registration process at www.muddypawsrescue.org. If you are already a registered adopter with Muddy Paws Rescue, please email us at adoptionmeetings@muddypawsrescue.org.","detail_url":"https://www.muddypawsrescue.org/adoptable?dog=010288","id":"b79977565eac79e995ed4fd81f8294f0","image_urls":["https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/B/BaltoAnimalId010288/i-LkbfZ9V/0/LMTMSh7bFvjPqt9FxwBTPWKFMvrHtzDNjXz9xdDnr/L/IMG_6179-L.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/B/BaltoAnimalId010288/i-hTkvKcK/0/LJCQSbpDZF9F8HL8K7SxwnjNMbcRnnLjcNrgkqBHh/XL/R6M20172-XL.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/B/BaltoAnimalId010288/i-QVQ6HMK/0/Ls8nGZNxgSR3S6KShfc5HGs3ZJk64rSxjgbW8GPjN/4K/IMG_6117-4K.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Indivi